<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 497-1 AT TEA V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 497-1 AT TEA V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, in reply to India's first innings total of 537 for 8 declared, were 497-1 at tea on the fourth day of the first test match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 1st innings 497-1 (S.Jayasuriya not out 274, R.Mahanama not out 177); India 1st innings 537 for 8 declared.</p>
</text>
